For the first time, the sky and the earth truly mingled. Within Kaelen’s dark depths, Aeliana’s starlit water kissed the dormant seeds of the world. From this profound union, tender green shoots burst through the soil, erupting into a riot of vibrant blossoms.

Thus, the first spring was born. 

The Sun’s attempt to destroy the snow only fueled a magnificent resurrection. Instead of hiding in the cold, their love bloomed fiercely in the light, covering Kaelen’s rugged terrain with a living, breathing tapestry of wildflowers that danced in eternal defiance of the jealous Sun.
